        "filing_date": "2026-04-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Due to the unique modularity of our Sactionals products, the compact design of our Snugg and the ability to shrink our Sacs, we are able to distribute our products through nationwide express couriers and efficiently utilize warehouse space and international shipping routes.",
