        "filing_date": "2026-04-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are continuously expanding and introducing new extensions to these platforms to broaden the appeal, grow the addressable market of our product offerings and ultimately continue to grow and evolve with our customers’ needs.",
